    # MC @ talk "Access to the Port will give you reach to Synmaria and more, only a fool couldn't see the value in that."
    MC @ talk "El acceso al puerto te dará acceso a Synmaria y más, solo un tonto no podría ver el valor en eso."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:103
