    # MC @ talk "And... to help smooth things over, that is why we have brought you Nijah."
    MC @ talk "Y... para ayudar a suavizar las cosas, por eso te hemos traído a Nijah."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:105
